{"slug":"15-1-partner","lang":"en","no":"15.1","title":"Partner","module":"Reports","module_no":"15","updated":"2026.08.26","version":"v2026.08.26","url":"https://help.infinityhu.eu/en/15-1-partner.html","sections":[{"no":"15.1.1","anchor":"15-1-1-partner-riportok","title":"Partner reports"},{"no":"15.1.2","anchor":"15-1-2-torzsvevok-lekerdezese","title":"Querying loyalty customers"}],"html":"<h2 id=\"15-1-1-partner-riportok\"><span class=\"hno\">15.1.1</span>Partner reports</h2><p>The partner data can be exported from the system's database with various filters and column definitions.</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://help.infinityhu.eu/media/img_d1d76cefe33c.png\" class=\"shot\" loading=\"lazy\"/></p><h2 id=\"15-1-2-torzsvevok-lekerdezese\"><span class=\"hno\">15.1.2</span>Querying loyalty customers</h2><p>Infinity has loyalty card management. When this report is run, the loyalty sales appear together with the sales data.</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://help.infinityhu.eu/media/img_d39776384298.png\" class=\"shot\" loading=\"lazy\"/></p>"}